[
{
"k": "22606",
"who": "BEAST",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "That's the place you want to check out if you're looking for the Crooked Man."
},
{
"k": "22607",
"who": "BEAST",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "He said I was reliable, and I could make more money running deliveries out of the Butcher Shop. And I'm not really in a position to go around turning down work."
},
{
"k": "22608",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "{angrya}[slow burn]Listen to me very carefully. Did you ever deliver to the Crooked Man? Can you give me an address?"
},
{
"k": "22609",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "Finally."
},
{
"k": "22610",
"who": "BEAUTY",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "That's the reason I'd stop in at the Lucky Pawn in the first place. You can find some real gems there."
},
{
"k": "22611",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "Well, at least you're getting a bargain."
},
{
"k": "22612",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "{angrya}You do know there's a difference between pawning something and selling it, don't you?"
},
{
"k": "22613",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "You're spending money you don't have."
},
{
"k": "22614",
"who": "BEAUTY",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "{sadb}I... I know that."
},
{
"k": "22615",
"who": "BEAST",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "{doubtfula}You know that butcher shop? The Cut Above?"
},
{
"k": "22616",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "{thinkingb}Why not?"
},
{
"k": "22617",
"who": "BEAST",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "Well, the weight of it isn't right...And..."
},
{
"k": "22618",
"who": "BEAST",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "{worrieda}No."
},
{
"k": "22619",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "You called me here, not her."
},
{
"k": "22620",
"who": "BEAST",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "You gotta understand, I needed work."
},
{
"k": "22621",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "Come on, just talk to me. We'll figure it out."
},
{
"k": "22622",
"who": "BEAST",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "I don't think it's meat in the packages."
},
{
"k": "22623",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "How the fuck did you end up working for the Crooked Man?"
},
{
"k": "22624",
"who": "BEAST",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "{worriedb}[apologetic]I couldn't tell you."
},
{
"k": "22625",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "<sarcastic> I'm sorry, were you expecting someone else?"
},
{
"k": "22626",
"who": "BEAUTY",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "<dismissive> No... it's fine. <annoyed> What do you want?"
},
{
"k": "22627",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "{doubtfula}If you don't wanna talk, can you just get Beast for me?"
},
{
"k": "22628",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "{angrya}If you don't wanna talk, can you just get Beauty for me?"
},
{
"k": "22629",
"who": "BEAST",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "[trying to make sense of it all] I never liked the guy, but Crane lived here in the Woodlands. I used to think it was a safe place..."
},
{
"k": "22630",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "Come on, you called me here to talk about the Crooked Man. Give me something I can use, damn it."
},
{
"k": "22631",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "{angryb}You're buying a piece of someone else's misery... with money you don't have."
},
{
"k": "22632",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "Place looks expensive."
},
{
"k": "22633",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "About the fight..."
},
{
"k": "22634",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "What did you call about?"
},
{
"k": "22635",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "Witholding evidence?"
},
{
"k": "22636",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "I can help."
},
{
"k": "22637",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "You're wasting my time."
},
{
"k": "22638",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "What have you done?"
},
{
"k": "22639",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "Sell your things!"
},
{
"k": "22640",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "Times are tough."
},
{
"k": "22641",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "{thinkingb}[unsure]Or, uh... was it Beast?"
},
{
"k": "22642",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "Pleny of jobs out there."
},
{
"k": "22643",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "Blame Beast, not me."
},
{
"k": "22644",
"who": "BEAST",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "[calling from inside the apartment]Who's there?"
},
{
"k": "22645",
"who": "BEAUTY",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "[calling from inside the apartment]Who is it?"
},
{
"k": "22646",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "It might have gone a bit differently if you'd told Beast what you were up to yourself."
},
{
"k": "22647",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "Invite me in?"
},
{
"k": "22648",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "Step aside."
},
{
"k": "22649",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "I got into another fight."
},
{
"k": "22650",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "Work off your debt!"
},
{
"k": "22651",
"who": "BEAST",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "{angrya}[curt]\tI gotta know one thing, first..."
},
{
"k": "22652",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "Can I talk to Beast?"
},
{
"k": "22653",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "Can I talk to Beauty?"
},
{
"k": "22654",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "{normalb}So, uh... let's not get into busting down doors today, alright?"
},
{
"k": "22655",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "You called?"
},
{
"k": "22656",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "Snow sent me."
},
{
"k": "22657",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "About the fight last night..."
},
{
"k": "22658",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "Listen..."
},
{
"k": "22659",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "I'll let it slide."
},
{
"k": "22660",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "So, believe me, that fight is the least of my worries right now."
},
{
"k": "22661",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "I've been through a hell of a lot worse, just since I saw you last."
},
{
"k": "22662",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "Maybe you should move?"
},
{
"k": "22663",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "Do you want to talk now?"
},
{
"k": "22664",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "Who were those people?"
},
{
"k": "22665",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "Is everything all right?"
},
{
"k": "22666",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "How did this start?"
},
{
"k": "22667",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "You're bringing trouble here."
},
{
"k": "22668",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "I'll take him down."
},
{
"k": "22669",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "What else do they sell?"
},
{
"k": "22670",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "Pawning isn't selling."
},
{
"k": "22671",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "Getting a bargain?"
},
{
"k": "22672",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "Give me info I can use."
},
{
"k": "22673",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "How can I help?"
},
{
"k": "22674",
"who": "BEAUTY",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "{SuspiciousA}[annoyed]What are you doing here?"
},
{
"k": "22675",
"who": "BEAST",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "{annoyedb}[annoyed]What do you want?"
},
{
"k": "22676",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "Crane is gone."
},
{
"k": "22677",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "The Crooked Man is dangerous."
},
{
"k": "22678",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "You'll be safe."
},
{
"k": "22679",
"who": "BEAUTY",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "But, Bigby..."
},
{
"k": "22680",
"who": "BEAUTY",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "This is about more than just money now..."
},
{
"k": "22681",
"who": "BEAUTY",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "[pleading] Bigby..."
},
{
"k": "22682",
"who": "BEAUTY",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "Sometimes it's Bloody Mary."
},
{
"k": "22683",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "We don't fix that."
},
{
"k": "22684",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "Can't pay it back?"
},
{
"k": "22685",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "I can help you."
},
{
"k": "22686",
"who": "BEAUTY",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "[interjecting] We've been smart about it."
},
{
"k": "22687",
"who": "BEAUTY",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "Sometimes Fables sell things they brought from the Homelands."
},
{
"k": "22688",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "Other people are in danger too."
},
{
"k": "22689",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "Give me something I can use. How do I find the Crooked Man?"
},
{
"k": "22690",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "Spending money you don't have."
},
{
"k": "22691",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "How did you get into trouble?"
},
{
"k": "22692",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "How did you even end up getting into this trouble anyway?"
},
{
"k": "22693",
"who": "BEAST",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "Bigby, we're in over our heads."
},
{
"k": "22694",
"who": "BEAST",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "We're in over our heads."
},
{
"k": "22695",
"who": "BEAST",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "I just want you to know that... this really isn't our fault."
},
{
"k": "22696",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "[understanding]I know. Times are tough."
},
{
"k": "22697",
"who": "BEAUTY",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "{nervousa}I'd overheard people talking to Jersey about loans before. So... when I needed money..."
},
{
"k": "22698",
"who": "BEAUTY",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "{sada}The Lucky Pawn. That's where I borrowed the money."
},
{
"k": "22699",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "Wait, who's Jersey?"
},
{
"k": "22700",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "{angrya}[partly to himself]That slimy prick... I didn't realize he was back on this side of the river."
},
{
"k": "22701",
"who": "BEAUTY",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "Yeah. You know, the Jersey Devil?"
},
{
"k": "22702",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "{angrya}Wait, who do you deal with?"
},
{
"k": "22703",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "He's been \"bridge and tunnel\" since before there were bridges OR tunnels."
},
{
"k": "22704",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "{thinkingb}[unsure]Or, uh... was it Beauty?"
},
{
"k": "22705",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "Neck on the line?"
},
{
"k": "22706",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "Why did Beast say his neck was on the line?"
},
{
"k": "22707",
"who": "BEAUTY",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "Nevermind... you know how he gets."
},
{
"k": "22708",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "Where did you get the loan?"
},
{
"k": "22709",
"who": "BEAST",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "{worriedc}I really needed the money. [ashamed] {worrieda}I still do."
},
{
"k": "22710",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "Mary got the axe from there."
},
{
"k": "22711",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "Was the Crooked Man there?"
},
{
"k": "22712",
"who": "BEAST",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "[giving in]Because... I think it's for the Crooked Man."
},
{
"k": "22713",
"who": "BEAST",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "You look like Hell, Bigby."
},
{
"k": "22714",
"who": "BEAST",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "You managed to come away looking worse than I did."
},
{
"k": "22715",
"who": "BEAST",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "[curt hmph]"
},
{
"k": "22716",
"who": "BEAUTY",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "{angrya}[annoyed]What do you want?"
},
{
"k": "22717",
"who": "BEAST",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "{angrya}[annoyed]What do you want, Bigby?"
},
{
"k": "22718",
"who": "BEAUTY",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "{angrya}I needed it."
},
{
"k": "22719",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "You wanted that job?"
},
{
"k": "22720",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "Consider yourself lucky."
},
{
"k": "22721",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "Why did you call?"
},
{
"k": "22722",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "I understand their anger."
},
{
"k": "22723",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "They are an asshole."
},
{
"k": "22724",
"who": "BEAUTY",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "{angrya}If someone called, it must have been Beast. {suspiciousa}I certainly didn't."
},
{
"k": "22725",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "{angryb}I told you to stop."
},
{
"k": "22726",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "{angryb}You just kept coming"
},
{
"k": "22727",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "{angryb}I told you you had the wrong idea."
},
{
"k": "22728",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "{angryb}Itold you I was on a murder case."
},
{
"k": "22729",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "{angryb}You didn't even give me a fucking chance to explain."
},
{
"k": "22730",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "And I told you I was on a case."
},
{
"k": "22731",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "{angrya}I was just there doing my job."
},
{
"k": "22732",
"who": "BEAUTY",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "You're not the only one."
},
{
"k": "22733",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "{angrya}And I really don't wanna deal with the runaround. {angryb}[beat]Snow said you called and wanted to talk to me."
},
{
"k": "22734",
"who": "BEAST",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "{angryb}You think you're the only one?"
},
{
"k": "22735",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "[reeling them in]I'd like to help you, but I can't do anything if you don't tell me what's going on."
},
{
"k": "22736",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "I can help you two."
},
{
"k": "22737",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "You could be next."
},
{
"k": "22738",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "Can we finish?"
},
{
"k": "22739",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "Are you gonna get that?"
},
{
"k": "22740",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "[Pick up phone]"
},
{
"k": "22741",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "Whose voice is that?"
},
{
"k": "22742",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "You ARE in trouble!"
},
{
"k": "22743",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "How deep are you?"
},
{
"k": "22744",
"who": "BEAST",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "And with what happened to Crane, I don't think it's crazy the think we're in danger."
},
{
