"k": "22794",
"who": "BEAUTY",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "Was... was it the Woodsman's axe?"
},
{
"k": "22795",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "It could have been his axe."
},
{
"k": "22796",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "What aren't you telling me?"
},
{
"k": "22797",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "Is the Woodsman involved?"
},
{
"k": "22798",
"who": "BEAUTY",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "It's just... I saw the Woodsman's axe at the Lucky Pawn a couple of days ago."
},
{
"k": "22799",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "I thought you were in debt - but this place doesn't look like it. What did you call about?"
},
