"en": "Yeah, the Cut Above."
},
{
"k": "22813",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "{angryb}[pissed off][disbelieving][accusatory]You're telling me that with a place like this, you're so hard up that you need to work for the Crooked Man? {angrya}That same guy you just told me you think is gonna kill you? [pointed]{angryc}Bullshit!"
