"k": "22833",
"who": "BEAST",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "{angrya}[accusatory][to Beauty]It's your pal, Bigby."
},
{
"k": "22834",
"who": "BEAST",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "{angrya}Figures."
},
{
"k": "22835",
"who": "BEAST",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "{annoyeda}[accusatory]I don't know. Is it safe to turn my back?"
},
{
"k": "22836",
"who": "BEAST",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "{worriedb}We're out of money and we're up against the wall here, okay?"
},
{
"k": "22837",
"who": "BEAUTY",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
