"k": "22852",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "So I gotta ask, what the hell did you get yourselves into?"
},
{
"k": "22853",
"who": "BEAUTY",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "Well, I didn't call."
},
{
"k": "22854",
"who": "BEAST",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "I didn't make that call."
},
{
"k": "22855",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "{angryb}But it doesn't look like you're suffering to me."
},
{
"k": "22856",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "{angryb}[pointed]So what's this about?"
},
{
"k": "22857",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "[ignoring their idle - getting down to business]{angrya}You've lived here a long time and you've never called me over."
},
{
"k": "22858",
"who": "BEAST",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "We owe the Crooked Man... [doesn't want to say how much]some money."
},
{
"k": "22859",
"who": "BEAUTY",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "[pleading]Bigby, we're in trouble. We owe the Crooked Man a lot of money."
