"k": "22864",
"who": "BEAUTY",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "I didn't know what else to do."
},
{
"k": "22865",
"who": "BEAUTY",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "I never thought it would come to this."
},
{
"k": "22866",
"who": "BEAUTY",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "You have to understand..."
},
{
"k": "22867",
"who": "BEAUTY",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "{angrya}[to Beast]We can't bring him into this. He's just going to make things worse. He always does."
},
{
"k": "22868",
"who": "BEAST",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "{annoyeda}Well he's here now, so let's see what he can do."
},
{
"k": "22869",
"who": "BEAST",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "{angrya}[to Beauty]We should deal with this on our own. Bigby's just going to complicate things."
},
{
"k": "22870",
"who": "BEAUTY",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "{angrya}I called him here, and I want to see if he can help us out."
},
{
"k": "22871",
"who": "BEAUTY",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "Why are you being like this?"
},
{
"k": "22872",
"who": "BEAST",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "That's all I ever do."
},
{
"k": "22873",
"who": "BEAST",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "I'm just trying to do what's best for us."
},
{
"k": "22874",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "You just gotta come clean with it. If you're involved with the Crooked Man, you gotta tell me what's going on."
},
{
"k": "22875",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "How can you be short on cash? Look at this place!"
},
{
"k": "22876",
"who": "BEAST",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "I just wanted to give Beauty the kind of life she deserves. You understand, don't you? And..."
},
{
"k": "22877",
"who": "BEAST",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "Bigby, we are"
},
{
"k": "22878",
"who": "BEAST",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "[pleading his case]There's not a lot of work out there."
},
{
"k": "22879",
"who": "BEAST",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "So that's how we came upon... some financial problems."
},
{
"k": "22880",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables104/env_beautybeastapt",
"en": "[pissed]You called me, okay? So cut the bullshit and quit wasting my time."
},
{
"k": "22881",
